# NAME|INPUT|RC|EXPECT
# -p and -a are list flags: they consume tokens until the next flag.
projects-one|ConsideraWeb app launch -p api -d|0|projects=api
projects-many|ConsideraWeb app launch -p api bff client -d|0|projects=api bff client
projects-long-form|ConsideraWeb app launch --projects api bff -d|0|projects=api bff
projects-stops-at-flag|ConsideraWeb app launch -p api bff -v -d|0|projects=api bff flags=-v -d
args-one|ConsideraWeb app run -a web -d|0|args=web
args-many|ConsideraWeb app run -a web admin -d|0|args=web admin
args-positional|ConsideraWeb app run web -d|0|args=web
args-positional-many|ConsideraWeb app run web admin -d|0|args=web admin
flags-order-independent|ConsideraWeb app launch -d -v -p api|0|projects=api
verbose-long-form|ConsideraWeb app launch --verbose -d|0|flags=--verbose -d
passthru-both|ConsideraWeb app launch -v -d|0|flags=-v -d
